{
  "id": "ISA.32",
  "number": "32",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isa 32",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olaiguanani le nkanyit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura kelo olaiguanani aitoreisho too sipat, nepuo ilkituaak aaitoreisho too nkiguanat naasipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelo ake atiu te pooki lenye anaa eneigarae te nkaraki olkutati, olchurie te nkaraki olkutati, netiu anaa nchorroi oo nkariak te nkop natoyio, netiu anaa oloip le ndapidapoi kitok te nkop e nauri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nkonyek e lelo oodol nemeitokini aaiken, ore nkiyiaa e lelo ooning nening. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore oltau le ilo opuny netum mbarakinot, ore olng'ejep le ilo oiramiram neiro aitorioki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemeigili aajo oltung'ani omoda kedupa, nemeji lelo aisimak eji keleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu mbaa e modai eiro olmodai nedamu mbaa entorroni to ltau lenye; pee etum ataasa ntorrok, neiro mbaa naapaashaa ti alo Olaitoriani, neing'uaa lelo ooisumash meeta toki, nemitiki ilo oata enkure enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkeleekisho e ilo kiminchali naa entorroni, entorroni eipiru ninye pee einyal ilo omena too rorei le lejare, hoo duoo ninye tenaa kesipa ewalata e ilo omena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ilo supat neiro mbaa e supatisho, ore too mbaa e supatisho neitashe ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkiguana o errinyunoto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyeito intae kuna kituaak naaisikarra, entoning oltoilo lai; natoyie kuna nemeshilaa toki, entoning enkiroroto ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkiti rishata naba anaa olari obo, nipuopuo intae aatum enyamali, intae kuna naaishiliga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "naaishiliga",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "naaidipakinote, nemeeta tipat e ae toki",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; amu meitoki aatii ilng'anayio, meitoki atii enkisampuare oo lng'anayio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkirikirata intae nakituaak kuna naaisikarra, entayu nkilani metaa minchopopo, nirretenene ilkuniyiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entooshiosh ilgooitie linyi te nkaraki nena kurman sidain, te nkaraki nena kurman oo sabibu naatoishete oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te ina kurma oo ltung'ana laainei nebulu ilkiku o endiati ee too nkajijik e nchipai te ina anasa e ng'ida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kepuoi aaing'uaa ina aji e nkitoo, neing'uari ina anasa naning'o; ore endoinyo o ine nerripishoreki nepuo aaku iwuejitin oo ng'uesi ntarasi, ewueji neitigiranie loitikoishi, neaku ndaat oo nkerrai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ometaba anaa nebukokini iyiook Enkiyang'et naing'uaa shumata, neaku ong'ata ewueji neisho oleng, ore ine neisho neiu ilng'anayio kumok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netum taa esupatisho atamanya ina ong'ata, nemany eseriani atua ina kurma naisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore esupatisho neiu eseriani, ore esupatisho neyau enkitirring'ata o nkirukoto ntarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepuo iltung'ana laainei aabik te manyisho e seriani ntarasi, ti atua ewueji e nkirrita oo wuejitin neeitirring'areki aayeng'iyeng'are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore entim neurori katukul, neurori katukul ina anasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imayianana intae lelo oounisho te mbata oo nkariak pooki, lelo ooisho ilmong'i o sirkon eidapashari aapuo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
